# RedDashboard.kt.bak Archive Note

This `.bak` file is preserved as an archived reference of the older RedDashboard
implementation (commit 0c0dcc28) that used the legacy `YounesCallOverlay`,
4-section navigation (HOME, CHATS, GROUPS, CALLS), and pre-unified
`CallHistoryRow` (non-clickable).

The current `RedDashboard.kt` is the canonical implementation with:
- 5-section navigation including MORE
- UnifiedCallOverlays priority system
- Clickable CallHistoryRow with RED_ID_PATTERN validation
- RoundCallAction with onClick parameter
- Full MoreScreen with 7 options (Dinstar/Privacy/Backup/Devices/Settings/Contacts/Communities)
- CreateSheet with Post/Poll/Story/Live/Explore
- Call dialer for 1-1 calls from CALLS section (fix from commit b11acc37)
- RichMessage mentions/hashtags/disappearing
- Mentions @ and Hashtags # autocomplete
- PostCard with edit/delete/hide/mute/report
- Stories with TEXT (background color) / VOICE (waveform) / VIDEO (trim) / IMAGE
- Story reactions ❤️🔥😢👏
- Search via FTS5
- Encrypted media cache
- etc.

The `.bak` is intentionally NOT deleted per project preservation policy.
